# --- mars native (see native/README.md) ------------------------------------
# These ARE committed so the plugin builds out-of-the-box (Git LFS recommended
# for the binaries, see .gitattributes):
#   native/mars/                         vendored, build-ready mars source
#   ios/Frameworks/mars.xcframework      prebuilt iOS framework
#   android/src/main/jniLibs/**/*.so     prebuilt Android libs
# Ignore only throwaway in-tree build output:
native/mars/cmake_build/
**/*.pyc
